{"unit_id":"pqkisvery666__dsh-basic-office#caveat-2","repo":"pqkisvery666/dsh-basic-office","commit":"cb801581fbba5db895d82b96f08ddf39ba3b64a1","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-basic-office 使用前须知：PDF 中的非 ASCII 文本依赖 Windows CJK 字体；生成器未找到这类字体时使用 Helvetica。见 lib/generators.js:265-287。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/generators.js:265-287"]}
